#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:5
#: fae79ffacc6e4bbea7b2af810747a445
msgid "ArduRoller Balance Bot"
msgstr "ArduRoller 平衡机器人"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:10
#: 700feba42fa94b5e95a335461b7fb313
msgid ""
"ArduRoller is a BalanceBot frame originally designed by Jason Short "
"(described in `this Makezine article "
"<https://makezine.com/projects/arduroller-self-balancing-robot/>`__).  "
"Rover-3.5 (and higher) supports this frame as described below."
msgstr ""
"ArduRoller 是由 Jason Short 最初设计的平衡机器人车架（详见 `此 Makezine 文章 "
"<https://makezine.com/projects/arduroller-self-balancing-"
"robot/>`__）。Rover-3.5（及更高版本）支持该车架，如下所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:12
#: f7daea19deb849bf9938ad948e867905
msgid ""
"One issue with this frame is that there is some play in the motors which "
"leads to a slightly wobble when standing still.  This could be resolved by "
"using `stepper motors "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/9172>`__"
msgstr ""
"该车架的一个问题是电机存在一定间隙，导致静止时会有轻微抖动。可通过使用 `步进电机 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/9172>`__ 来解决此问题"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:15
#: af78385cf0ec43439893f12a778e2f1d
msgid "Parts List"
msgstr "零件清单"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:17
#: 623cb8dd5c484e56812cd1374e2c2b5d
msgid ""
"`ArduRoller 3D printed frame from Thingiverse.com "
"<https://www.thingiverse.com/thing:810998>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Thingiverse.com 上的 ArduRoller 3D 打印车架 "
"<https://www.thingiverse.com/thing:810998>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:18
#: 25e0cf4f7eef4b64a15650c7234b6896
msgid ""
"`4\" clear platic globe <https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B0044SEKA0>`__ "
"(optional)"
msgstr "`4 英寸透明塑料球 <https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B0044SEKA0>`__ （可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:19
#: b24d6c1a824d467fbbb87c7c099be871
msgid ""
"`mRobotics Pixhawk autopilot <https://store.mrobotics.io/Genuine-PixHawk-"
"Flight-Controller-p/mro-pixhawk1-minkit-mr.htm>`__.  :ref:`Other autopilots "
"<common-autopilots>` may also work but they must have GPIO input pins to "
"support the :ref:`wheel encoders <wheel-encoder>`."
msgstr ""
"`mRobotics Pixhawk 飞控 <https://store.mrobotics.io/Genuine-PixHawk-Flight-"
"Controller-p/mro-pixhawk1-minkit-mr.htm>`__。:ref:`其他飞控 <common-autopilots>` "
"也可能适用，但必须具有 GPIO 输入引脚以支持 :ref:`轮速编码器 <wheel-encoder>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:20
#: 70ae6e97624e483ca177b1f168ac1623
msgid ""
"`RoboClaw 2x7A motor controller <https://www.pololu.com/product/3284>`__"
msgstr "`RoboClaw 2x7A 电机控制器 <https://www.pololu.com/product/3284>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:21
#: fe06c1fa569a4f8da775f101b0281785
msgid ""
"`Pololu 12V 2.1A 34:1 motors with encoders "
"<https://www.pololu.com/product/3240>`__"
msgstr "`Pololu 12V 2.1A 34:1 带编码器电机 <https://www.pololu.com/product/3240>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:22
#: cc295b9c2cb147a69f0f03af7580e24c
msgid ""
"`Wild Thumber Wheels with 4mm shaft adapters "
"<https://www.pololu.com/product/1557>`__"
msgstr "`Wild Thumper 车轮及 4mm 轴适配器 <https://www.pololu.com/product/1557>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:23
#: fc795f4c27ef4dc28d01986ad641e2e1
msgid ""
"small 3S battery like the `Turnigy 1600mAh 3S 20C "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-1600mah-3s-20c-lipo-pack.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"小型 3S 电池，如 `Turnigy 1600mAh 3S 20C "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-1600mah-3s-20c-lipo-pack.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:24
#: d92d7305147043339e393c66525f8160
msgid ""
"any 8 channel (or more) transmitter like the `Futaba T10J "
"<https://www.futabarc.com/systems/futk9200-10j/index.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"任意 8 通道（或更多）发射机，如 `Futaba T10J "
"<https://www.futabarc.com/systems/futk9200-10j/index.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:27
#: 6f41495812774ccebdbfaa17a84ea9a4
msgid "Connection and Setup"
msgstr "连接与设置"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:29
#: c182ddd505214dbaa2ed69209a1bf556
msgid "Setup the Roboclaw motor driver:"
msgstr "设置 Roboclaw 电机驱动器："

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:31
#: 20fb4f5ecdea404d850749f0555b16bd
msgid "Download and install the ION Studio configuration software"
msgstr "下载并安装 ION Studio 配置软件"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:32
#: b3e2594d2ca846299a7893f9c4a8a806
msgid "Connect the Roboclaw motor driver to your PC with a USB cable"
msgstr "用 USB 线将 Roboclaw 电机驱动器连接到电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:33
#: 7f697300fbff465c804b0aa8c995660a
msgid ""
"Connect with ION Studio then on the General Settings page, set Control Mode "
"= RC"
msgstr "用 ION Studio 连接，在「General Settings」页面将 Control Mode 设为 RC"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:34
#: 3eacbaa90a33476c80785f49d0134882
msgid "From the File menu, \"Save Setting\""
msgstr "通过「File」菜单，选择「Save Setting」"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:40
#: 63f0217c10ce4dcd9c7cfc9fbcae332b
msgid ""
"Connect the yellow and white wires from the wheel encoders to the AUX OUT "
"3,4,5,6 pins as described on the :ref:`wheel encoder wiki page <wheel-"
"encoder>`"
msgstr ""
"按照 :ref:`轮速编码器 Wiki 页面 <wheel-encoder>` 的说明，将轮速编码器的黄色和白色导线连接到 AUX OUT "
"3、4、5、6 引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:41
#: fd1196abbb1444f8ab7a2a11b123ea28
msgid "Connect the autopilot, motor driver and motors as shown below"
msgstr "按下图所示连接飞控、电机驱动器和电机"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:47
#: 92144f2366dc4043a2ed0c517e520e1c
msgid "Firmware used: Rover-3.5"
msgstr "固件版本：Rover-3.5"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-arduroller.rst:49
#: e99e790f508444f6b32d43f05348eabc
msgid ""
"Parameter file: `ArduRoller BalanceBot "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/Frame_params/ArduRoller-"
"balancebot.param>`__"
msgstr ""
"参数文件：`ArduRoller BalanceBot "
